## Quick Start

### 1. Install Opperator

If you don't have Opperator installed:

```bash
curl -fsSL https://opper.ai/opperator-install | bash
```

### 2. Install this Agent

```bash
op agent install {{.PackageName}}
```

**Manual install (available now):**

Clone this repository into your Opperator agents directory:

```bash
git clone <this-repo> ~/.config/opperator/agents/{{.AgentName}}
cd ~/.config/opperator/agents/{{.AgentName}}
```

Create a virtual environment and install dependencies:

```bash
# Using uv (recommended)
uv venv .venv
uv pip install .

# Or using standard Python
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate  # On Windows: .venv\Scripts\activate
pip install -e .
```

